      en: ["The highest peak is Pico de São Macário at 1052m.", "Home to the unique 'Pedras Parideiras' geological feature.", "Frecha da Mizarela waterfall drops from 75 meters.", "The area is part of the UNESCO Arouca Geopark.", "Drave is a renowned abandoned schist village.", "Significant wolfram mining occurred here during WWII."],
