      en: ["The peak of Fóia reaches an altitude of 902 meters", "Only region in Portugal with a predominantly syenite geology", "Features a more humid microclimate than the surrounding Algarve", "Renowned for thermal springs used since the Roman era", "Major cultivation area for the strawberry tree (Medronho)", "Habitat for a rare population of the Iberian lynx"],
